      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "index": 0,
            "text": "The Lead Claims Agreement Party is deemed to be the [[DefinedData0]] unless otherwise specified here."
          },
          {
            "index": 1,
            "text": "For Lloyd’s syndicates, the leading Lloyd’s syndicate and, where required by the applicable Lloyd’s Claims Scheme, the second Lloyd’s syndicate. The second Lloyd’s syndicate is SII 1945."
          },
          {
            "index": 2,
            "text": "For company (re)insurers, all IUA subscribing companies agree to follow the IUA claims agreement practices."
          },
