            "text": "All other subscribing (re)insurers, each in respect of their own participation, that are not party to the Lloyd’s or IUA claims agreement practices, agree to follow the decisions of the Lloyd’s and IUA claims agreement parties or the lead Claims Agreement Party where such is not otherwise the Lloyd’s or IUA lead, excepting those that may have opted out below."
